@HelpDev.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5221

### Auth — send OTP
POST {{HelpDev.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobile": "09123456789"
}

###

### Auth — verify OTP
POST {{HelpDev.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobile": "09123456789",
  "code": "123456"
}

###

GET {{HelpDev.API_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Test — content (JWT required, any role)
GET {{HelpDev.API_HostAddress}}/api/test/content
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Test — users (JWT + Admin only)
GET {{HelpDev.API_HostAddress}}/api/test/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Secure — requires JWT (401 without token)
GET {{HelpDev.API_HostAddress}}/api/secure
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Content — list published
GET {{HelpDev.API_HostAddress}}/api/content
Accept: application/json

###

### Content — get by slug
GET {{HelpDev.API_HostAddress}}/api/content/my-article
Accept: application/json

###

### Content — create (Writer/Admin only)
POST {{HelpDev.API_HostAddress}}/api/content
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "اولین مقاله",
  "slug": "first-article",
  "body": "متن مقاله...",
  "type": "Article",
  "status": "Published"
}

###
